{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o003a","title":"清河王曹冏去世","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o003a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"清河王曹冏去世","evidence":["mingdi-e-o003a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0004","role":"卒","evidence":["mingdi-e-o003a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":226,"label":"冬十月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y226","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o001","basis":"冬十月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o003a-q","mingdi-q-o001","mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o003a-q","source_order":[3,19,"O003a"],"order":712}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0004","name":"曹冏","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-362802bfee7aff4bb79e","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，清河王冏薨。十二月，以太尉钟繇为太傅〖10〗，征东大将军曹休为大司马，中军大将军曹真为大将军，司徒华歆为太尉，司空王朗为司徒，镇军大将军陈群为司空，抚军大将军司马宣王为骠骑（大）将军。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
